        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Workweek of the Company consists of seven (7) consecutive calendar days beginning with Sunday, except that for Employees on tours which start less than four (4) hours before Saturday midnight and extend into Sunday, the Workweek shall be considered as beginning with the start of such tours.",
